        <!-- Note -->
        <mxCell id="note" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=11;fontColor=#5F5E5A;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="Synthesis is manual (no API/tokens). Corpus is transient (7-day; regenerates). Runs on a dedicated collector host; a hardened production node is planned (deferred until the effort proves a keeper). The corpus bridge is swappable — object storage or a self-served corpus are the planned alternatives." vertex="1">
